{"id":"n4-114","title":"～まで","romaji":"〜made","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Indicates extent, 'until', 'up to', 'as far as', 'even'.","longExplanation":"The ～まで grammar point is used to express extent or range in terms of time, distance, or degree. It can be translated as 'until', 'up to', 'as far as', or 'even' in English. It is used with verbs, い-adjectives, な-adjectives, or nouns.","formation":"Verb + まで, い-Adjective + まで, な-Adjective + まで, Noun + まで","examples":[{"jp":"仕事が終わるまで待っています。","romaji":"Shigoto ga owaru made matteimasu.","en":"I will wait until work is finished.","words":[{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終わる","vocabId":"1589600","reading":"おわる"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"待っ","vocabId":"1410590","reading":"まつ","baseForm":"待つ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"ここから駅まで歩いて10分かかります。","romaji":"Koko kara eki made aruite juppun kakarimasu.","en":"It takes 10 minutes to walk from here to the station.","words":[{"surface":"ここ","vocabId":"1288810","reading":"ここ"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"駅","vocabId":"1175140","reading":"えき"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歩い","vocabId":"1514320","reading":"あるく","baseForm":"歩く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"10","vocabId":null},{"surface":"分","vocabId":"1502860","reading":"ぶん"},{"surface":"かかり","vocabId":"1589840","reading":"かかり","baseForm":"かかる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"私は彼が成功するまで応援します。","romaji":"Watashi wa kare ga seikou suru made ouen shimasu.","en":"I will support him until he succeeds.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"応援","vocabId":"1179840","reading":"おうえん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6]},{"jp":"彼女は猫まで好きです。","romaji":"Kanojo wa neko made suki desu.","en":"She likes even cats.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"猫","vocabId":"1467640","reading":"ねこ"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"好き","vocabId":"1277450","reading":"すき"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"Casual-to-neutral \"even/to the point of\" - overlaps with さえ in everyday speech.","family":{"id":"emphasis-even","name":"Emphasis (Even)","relatedPoints":["n3-022","n2-089","n1-032","n1-060","n3-099","n2-147","n1-030","n1-063"]}}